<title>PHILIPPINES: Vitarich recovers from loss, Q1 net up.</title>
<headline>Vitarich recovers from loss, Q1 net up.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three months to March 31</p>
<p>	 (in million pesos unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net sales (billion)	    1.48 vs 1.41</p>
<p>    Net income/(loss)		3.69 vs (290.38)</p>
<p>Note: Full name Vitarich Corp. The poultry grower said the downsizing of broiler production solved the problem of oversupply. Prices have increased 28 percent from last year while costs went down 13 percent.</p>
<p>-- MANILA NEWSROOM (63 2) 841-8938 Fax 817-6267</p>
